         recommended test: At least one candidate test fails on the defect in the throwaway copy, and that single failure is enough to mark the defect as covered.
           inputs:  A tiny project with one candidate test that fails under an injected edit by raising NameError/ImportError/ModuleNotFoundError/UnboundLocalError, while another candidate test still passes; run the mutation tier on a defect whose edit intentionally triggers that failure type but is otherwise a real behavioral change.
