      src/acceptance/pipeline.py#3
    [scope_too_narrow] run-candidate-tests-on-throwaway-copy/collectable-test-filter-drops-candidate-tests
      The collection gate can drop candidate tests that pytest would not collect together, so only a subset of the project's candidate tests are actually run on the throwaway copy.
