    [missing_case] run-candidate-tests-on-throwaway-copy/mutation-runner-only-runs-when-baseline-has-usable-tests
      If the baseline leaves no usable tests, the mutation runner returns without running any candidate tests on the throwaway copy, even though the criterion still asks for that execution.
